# Sample PDF/DOCX are committed as regular blobs by default (small enough:
# < 6 MB combined). If this repo's data grows, Git LFS is the recommended
# path for large/binary files - uncomment the lines below and run
# `git lfs track '*.pdf' '*.docx'` (see CONTRIBUTING.md). Not enabled by
# default because it requires the hosting/CI credentials used for pushes to
# support the Git LFS batch API, which not every git host/integration does.
# *.pdf filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.docx filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
